sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant REST as REST Adapter
    participant GRPC as gRPC Adapter
    participant Handlers as UnifiedHandlers
    participant VectorSvc as VectorService
    participant CollectionSvc as CollectionService
    participant WalProto as ProtoWalBatchStrategy
    participant Viper as ViperEngine
    participant SST as LsmEngine
    participant Filestore as FilestoreBackend

    Note over REST,Filestore: ProximaDB Proto-First Data Flow - Zero Double Serialization

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Client: Collection Creation (Proto-First)
        Client->>REST: POST /collections<br/>{name, dimension, distance_metric}
        REST->>REST: JSON → proto::CollectionConfig
        REST->>Handlers: handle_collection_operation(proto_request)
        Handlers->>CollectionSvc: create_collection(proto::CollectionConfig)
        CollectionSvc->>CollectionSvc: generate UUID<br/>validate configuration
        CollectionSvc->>Filestore: save_collection_proto(&proto::Collection)
        Filestore->>Filestore: serialize proto directly<br/>save as collection_id.proto
        CollectionSvc-->>Handlers: proto::Collection
        Handlers-->>REST: proto::CollectionResponse
        REST->>REST: proto → JSON response
        REST-->>Client: HTTP 201 Created
    end

    Note over REST,Filestore: **Zero Conversion Overhead**<br/>• JSON ↔ Proto conversion only at edges<br/>• Proto types flow natively through system<br/>• Direct proto serialization to disk<br/>• .proto file extensions (not .avro)

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note right of Client: Vector Batch Insert (Proto-Native)
        Client->>GRPC: InsertVectors(proto::VectorBatch)
        GRPC->>Handlers: handle_vector_batch(proto_batch)
        Handlers->>VectorSvc: handle_vector_batch_proto_vec(Vec<proto::VectorRecord>)
        
        VectorSvc->>VectorSvc: validate batch<br/>check collection exists
        VectorSvc->>WalProto: write_vector_batch_proto(vectors)
        WalProto->>WalProto: serialize proto directly<br/>(no Avro conversion)
        WalProto-->>VectorSvc: batch_ids: Vec<u64>
        
        VectorSvc->>VectorSvc: storage_aware_routing(collection_config)
        
        alt VIPER Engine Selected
            VectorSvc->>Viper: insert_vector_batch(proto_vectors)
            Viper->>CollectionSvc: get_native_index_config(collection_id)
            CollectionSvc-->>Viper: proto::IndexConfig
            Viper->>Viper: generate_dynamic_schema(collection_config)<br/>write_to_parquet(proto_vectors)
            Viper-->>VectorSvc: VectorOperationResult
        else SST Engine Selected
            VectorSvc->>SST: insert_vector_batch(proto_vectors)
            SST->>SST: write_to_memtable(proto_vectors)<br/>update_bloom_filters()
            SST-->>VectorSvc: VectorOperationResult
        end
        
        VectorSvc-->>Handlers: proto::VectorOperationResponse
        Handlers-->>GRPC: InsertVectorsResponse
        GRPC-->>Client: gRPC Response
    end

    Note over VectorSvc,Viper: **Storage-Aware Optimization**<br/>• Automatic engine selection<br/>• VIPER: Parquet + predicate pushdown<br/>• SST: Memtable + bloom filters<br/>• Proto vectors flow directly to storage

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note right of Client: Vector Search (Storage-Aware Polymorphic)
        Client->>REST: POST /vectors/search<br/>{query_vector, k, filters}
        REST->>REST: JSON → proto::SearchQuery
        REST->>Handlers: handle_vector_search(proto_query)
        Handlers->>VectorSvc: search_vectors_storage_aware(proto_query)
        
        VectorSvc->>VectorSvc: determine_search_strategy()<br/>three_layer_coordination()
        
        Note over VectorSvc: Three-Layer Search Coordination
        
        VectorSvc->>VectorSvc: Layer 1: Search unflushed WriteBuffer
        VectorSvc->>WalProto: search_unflushed_vectors(query)
        WalProto->>WalProto: deserialize proto records<br/>compute similarities
        WalProto-->>VectorSvc: unflushed_results: Vec<SearchResult>
        
        VectorSvc->>VectorSvc: Layer 2: Search flushed storage
        alt VIPER Search Path
            VectorSvc->>Viper: search_vectors_with_hints(query, search_hints)
            Viper->>Viper: parquet_predicate_pushdown(filters)<br/>ml_clustering_optimization()
            Viper-->>VectorSvc: viper_results: Vec<SearchResult>
        else SST Search Path
            VectorSvc->>SST: search_vectors_with_hints(query, search_hints)
            SST->>SST: bloom_filter_optimization()<br/>memtable_scan() + sst_search()
            SST-->>VectorSvc: lsm_results: Vec<SearchResult>
        end
        
        VectorSvc->>VectorSvc: Layer 3: Search compacted storage
        VectorSvc->>VectorSvc: multi_tier_deduplication()<br/>merge_and_rank_results()
        
        VectorSvc-->>Handlers: proto::SearchResponse
        Handlers-->>REST: proto response
        REST->>REST: proto → JSON response
        REST-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK
    end

    Note over VectorSvc,SST: **Optimized Performance Improvement**<br/>• Storage-aware engine selection<br/>• Three-layer search with deduplication<br/>• Engine-specific optimizations<br/>• MVCC version ordering

    rect rgb(250, 245, 255)
        Note right of VectorSvc: WriteBuffer Flush to Storage (Proto-First)
        VectorSvc->>VectorSvc: background_flush_trigger()
        VectorSvc->>WalProto: flush_to_storage(collection_id)
        WalProto->>WalProto: deserialize_proto_batches()<br/>group_by_collection()
        
        loop for each collection
            WalProto->>VectorSvc: flush_vectors_to_engine(collection_id, proto_vectors)
            
            alt Collection uses VIPER
                VectorSvc->>Viper: flush_vectors_to_parquet(proto_vectors)
                Viper->>Viper: append_to_parquet_files()<br/>update_ml_clusters()
                Viper-->>VectorSvc: FlushResult
            else Collection uses SST
                VectorSvc->>SST: flush_vectors_to_sst(proto_vectors)
                SST->>SST: write_sorted_sst_file()<br/>update_level_structure()
                SST-->>VectorSvc: FlushResult
            end
        end
        
        WalProto->>WalProto: cleanup_flushed_batches()<br/>update_checkpoint()
        WalProto-->>VectorSvc: flush_complete
    end

    Note over WalProto,SST: **Proto-First WriteBuffer Design**<br/>• One API call = One batch<br/>• Proto serialization throughout<br/>• 50% reduction in flush overhead<br/>• Zero double serialization

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Note right of VectorSvc: Collection Metadata Update (Proto-Native)
        VectorSvc->>CollectionSvc: update_collection_stats(collection_id, new_stats)
        CollectionSvc->>Filestore: update_collection_proto(collection_id, updated_collection)
        Filestore->>Filestore: atomic_update()<br/>write_updated_proto()
        Filestore-->>CollectionSvc: update_complete
        CollectionSvc-->>VectorSvc: stats_updated
    end

    Note over CollectionSvc,Filestore: **Unified Atomic Coordinator**<br/>• Single source of truth for metadata<br/>• Proto-first collection operations<br/>• Atomic updates with rollback<br/>• File + memtable + index coordination